        "description": {
          "en": "Lightweight Race Hydration Vest (4 Litres) is a Restrap backpack in 4 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
          "ru": "Рюкзак Restrap объёмом 4 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
        },
        "manufacturerDetails": "When your only goal is to ride from A-B in the fastest time possible, your priorities are aerodynamics, comfort, weight and to be able to access fuel as ergonomically as possible. The Restrap Lightweight Hydration Vest is built without compromise. READ MORE\nStripped back weight, no compromise to function. Building on our award winning Race Hydration Vest, but reducing the overall capacity of the vest, we have improved its breathability, reduced its weight; but kept all the features that made the original so popular. \nWorking with UCI gravel race winners, FKT setters and one-day specialists, what was initially an exercise in cutting back weight from the classic Race Hydration Vest became a ground-up redesign. \nMinimalist construction\nThe lightweight mesh construction features four stretch pockets on the front, an underarm stretch pocket on each side. That full stretch construction means complete freedom of movement while on the bike. Minimalist elastic chest retention can be adjusted and even unclipped with one hand; ready for fast changes at feedzones. \nThe rear includes a hydration bladder sleeve (bladder included). Hose routing can be run over either shoulder, with a magnetic clip to hold the hose in place when not in use. And because even on the shortest races, conditions can change, there’s a stretch rear pocket for an emergency layer. We’ve included reflective detailing to increase visibility at night. \nFitting\nThe Lightweight Race Hydration Vest comes in two sizes: \nS/M – chest sizes between 80 and 100cm – t-shirt size XS to M\nL/XL – chest size between 100 and 12cm – t-shirt size M to XXL",
        "sourceImageUrl": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/4941/files/LightweightRaceHydrationVest.jpg?v=1780043881&width=700",
