        "description": {
          "en": "Race Hydration Vest is a Restrap backpack in 7.5 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
          "ru": "Рюкзак Restrap объёмом 7.5 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
        },
        "manufacturerDetails": "Introducing our Race Hydration Vest, a comfortable and practical way to carry fluids and nutrition while riding long distances or out into the unknown. Made with a focus on functionality, the Race Hydration Vest is designed specifically around fuelling on the bike. The high placement on the back ensures maximum comfort in the riding position and compatibility with jersey pockets, allowing for easy access to essentials while on the move. It has been developed to adopt a genuine unisex design, ensuring comfort for individuals across all genders and body types. READ MORE \nThe Race Hydration Vest prioritizes comfort with three points of adjustment – sides, shoulders, and chest. The chest retention system offers five points of adjustment, featuring stretch webbing, an integrated whistle for safety, and an easy on and off clip system that is glove-friendly. Equipped with a 2L bladder, the pack features an expandable internal lining for superior bladder fitment, eliminating any discomfort during extended rides. The back of the pack has two stretch mesh drop pockets that will easily hold two extra bottles and webbing loops that can be used for carabiner attachment for other items, such as race trackers. The front of the pack features easy-to-reach stretch mesh pockets ideal for carrying a water bottle and snacks. Also featured is an expandable zip pocket with a key clip inside, for quick access to valuables. The ambidextrous bladder routing system and adjustable magnetic keeper clip allows users to choose exactly where they want to route the drinking tube and store it when not in use. The inclusion of reflective zip pulls, logos, and webbing detailing enhances visibility from all angles, aiding safety during low-light conditions. A light loop also allows attachment of a clip-on light. Available in two sizes: Small/Medium & Large/XL Weight - (without bladder) Small/Medium - 368g Large/XL - 380g Bladder weight 146g Capacity - 5.5L with 2L Bladder Capacity (7.5L total)",
